,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21830},{"id":1786337829433,"text":"评论比正文还好看，这种水文看多了只会让你觉得浪费时间。","rawContent":"评论比正文还好看，这种水文看多了只会让你觉得浪费时间。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:48","timestamp":1786351714782,"roundId":"round_1786351683865_pho0ervzp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21831},{"id":1786337829434,"text":"别看了，把那个界面叉掉，免得越看越心烦，还白白浪费了眼睛。","rawContent":"别看了，把那个界面叉掉，免得越看越心烦，还白白浪费了眼睛。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:48","timestamp":1786351715002,"roundId":"round_1786351683865_pho0ervzp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21832},{"id":1786337829435,"text":"盯着屏幕看了一个多小时，中午刚睡醒那点精神是不是又耗光了？","rawContent":"盯着屏幕看了一个多小时，中午刚睡醒那点精神是不是又耗光了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:48","timestamp":1786351715215,"roundId":"round_1786351683865_pho0ervzp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21833},{"id":1786337829436,"text":"眼睛酸不酸？后腰僵没僵？","rawContent":"眼睛酸不酸？后腰僵没僵？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:48","timestamp":1786351715334,"roundId":"round_1786351683865_pho0ervzp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21834},{"id":1786337829437,"text":"听话，现在站起来，去茶水间接杯温水。","rawContent":"听话，现在站起来，去茶水间接杯温水。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"16:48","timestamp":1786351715527,"roundId":"round_1786351683865_pho0ervzp","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":21835},{"id":1786337829438,"text":"顺便活动一下肩膀，别一直窝在那个硬椅子上。","rawCont